{"unit_id":"tag:0F0E:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>对于<MATH_0002>成立，且<MATH_0003>对于<MATH_0004>成立。可以将<MATH_0005>表示为下有界（bounded below）复形（complex）<MATH_0006>，由无挠（torsion free）的<MATH_0007>模（modules）组成。（选取一个 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex）<MATH_0008>表示<MATH_0009>，然后取<MATH_0010>。这可行，因为<MATH_0011>的整体维数（dimension）为<MATH_0012>。见《代数（Algebra）进阶》，引理<REF_0001>。）可以将<MATH_0013>表示为下有界（bounded below）复形（complex）<MATH_0014>。于是<MATH_0015>由\n<MATH_0016>\n表示。使用特征三角（distinguished triangles）\n<MATH_0017>\n，以及直接的消失性\n<MATH_0018>\n和\n<MATH_0019>\n，归约到<MATH_0020>为有界（bounded）复形（complex）的情形，其项为平坦（flat）的<MATH_0021>模（modules）。重复这一论证，归约到<MATH_0022>等于单个平坦（flat）的<MATH_0023>模（module）的情形，该对象位于某个次数（degree）。接着，对<MATH_0024>使用粗截断（stupid trunctions），以完全相同的方式归约到<MATH_0025>为单个阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）的情形，它位于某个次数（degree）。因此只需证明\n<MATH_0026>\n，条件是<MATH_0027>为平坦（flat）的<MATH_0028>模（module），且<MATH_0029>为<MATH_0030>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。此时将<MATH_0031>写成有限自由（finite free）的<MATH_0032>模（modules）的滤过余极限（filtered colimit）（Lazard 定理，见《代数（Algebra）》，定理<REF_0002>）。由定理<REF_0003>，这归约为有限自由（finite free）的<MATH_0033>模（module）<MATH_0034>的情形，此时结论直接成立。\n","allowed_english":["K-","Lazard"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"下有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"torsion free","target_term":"无挠"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"下有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangles","target_term":"特征三角"},{"source_term":"bounded","target_term":"有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term"