{"unit_id":"tag:0GJM:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节从光滑（smooth）基变换（base change）定理推出光滑（smooth）态射（morphisms）的局部无环性（local acyclicity）。在 SGA 4 或 SGA 4.5 中，作者先对光滑（smooth）态射（morphisms）证明一个版本的局部无环性（local acyclicity），然后推出光滑（smooth）基变换（base change）定理。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们使用 Deligne <REF_0001>给出的局部无环性（local acyclicity）表述。设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的一个几何点（geometric point），其像（image）为<MATH_0004>，位于<MATH_0005>中。设<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>的一个几何点（geometric point）。得到交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0008>\n。概形（scheme）<MATH_0009>称为一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>消失圈簇（variety of vanishing cycles），对应于<MATH_0010>，在（at）<MATH_0011>处<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。设<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>的一个对象（object）。对于任意概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0014>，用<MATH_0015>替代<MATH_0016>作为记号。由于<MATH_0017>严格亨泽尔（strictly henselian），有<MATH_0018>。因此得到典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0019>\n，它是沿<MATH_0020>拉回（pulling back）上同调（cohomology）所得。\n\n","allowed_english":["SGA","Deligne"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"local acyclicity","target_term":"局部无环性"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"local acyclicity","target_term":"局部无环性"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"local acyclicity","target_term":"局部无环性"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"variety of vanishing cycles","target_term":"消失圈簇"},{"source_term":"at","target_term":"在"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"strictly henselian","target_term":"严格亨泽尔"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"pulling back","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"态射及基变换定理"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"局部无环性的推导"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"局部无环性对象"},{"source_term":"local acyclicity","target_term":"局部无环性","context":"本节概念"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射的对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"局部定义"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点","context":"严格局部化"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"几何点的像"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"严格局部化的关系"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"消失圈簇"},{"source_term":"variety of vanishing cycles","target_term":"消失圈簇","context":"定义名称"},{"source_term":"at","target_term":"在","context":"来源目录要求的定义坐标词形"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"系数对象"},{"source_term":"strictly henselian","target_term":"严格亨泽尔","context":"严格局部化的性质"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"局部无环性比较"},{"source_term":"pulling back","target_term":"拉回","context":"比较映射的构造"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"比较对象"}],"notes":[]}
